freedreno: accept the Adreno 613 (the Retroid Pocket Classic's GPU)

The kernel's a613 catalog entry reports gpu id 613, which freedreno_devices.py in
26.0.1 has no entry for, so fd_pipe_new2() refuses the GPU. Mesa 26.2.0 carries
the same GPUId in the a6xx gen1 low block; add it here.

--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -451,6 +451,7 @@
         GPUId(608), # TODO: Test it, based only on libwrapfake dumps
         GPUId(610),
         GPUId(612), # TODO: Test it, based only on libwrapfake dumps
+        GPUId(613), # Adreno 613 (Retroid Pocket Classic): a6xx gen1, as the kernel's catalog has it
     ], A6xxGPUInfo(
         CHIP.A6XX,
         [a6xx_base, a6xx_gen1_low],
